WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.950
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:38.220 --> 01:43.960
[Small Town Remedy]

3
01:44.080 --> 01:46.950
[Episode 25]

4
01:46.979 --> 01:49.690
[Xiaoximen Hospital Affiliated with Qikang Medical]

5
01:48.310 --> 01:49.240
So the three of us

6
01:49.350 --> 01:50.550
are a team from now on?

7
01:51.039 --> 01:51.870
You bet.

8
01:53.229 --> 01:54.560
Everything's changed.

9
01:54.560 --> 01:56.039
Even Dr. Che's been let go.

10
01:57.310 --> 01:58.509
Chief Physician Liu,

11
01:58.640 --> 02:00.500
we're counting on you from now on.

12
02:01.710 --> 02:03.950
From now on, everything will be managed at the group level.

13
02:03.950 --> 02:06.210
Is being the hospital president any fun?

14
02:06.510 --> 02:07.350
I used to get

15
02:07.350 --> 02:09.240
four or five hours of sleep a night.

16
02:09.240 --> 02:10.120
Now that I'm president,

17
02:10.120 --> 02:11.470
I'm lucky

18
02:11.470 --> 02:12.360
if I get two.

19
02:12.750 --> 02:14.280
It's because I keep worrying about all these things.

20
02:14.280 --> 02:15.430
The more I think about it, the harder it gets.

21
02:15.430 --> 02:16.520
So I've decided to stop thinking about it.

22
02:16.520 --> 02:18.400
Let them criticize me all they want.

23
02:18.400 --> 02:20.030
The number of available positions is limited.

24
02:20.030 --> 02:21.360
What am I supposed to do?

25
02:21.910 --> 02:24.520
Liu, Tong, and Sun

26
02:24.710 --> 02:25.970
have all come to see me.

27
02:26.310 --> 02:27.370
What did they want?

28
02:29.750 --> 02:32.310
They wanted to know why you were made hospital president.

29
02:32.310 --> 02:33.800
So I explained

30
02:33.800 --> 02:35.240
your predicament to them.

31
02:35.240 --> 02:36.440
Guess what they said?

32
02:36.960 --> 02:40.690
They must have thought being hospital president wasn't that hard.

33
02:41.360 --> 02:42.280
Director Yan

34
02:43.590 --> 02:44.800
can't interfere

35
02:44.800 --> 02:47.470
with the company's internal management, of course.

36
02:47.470 --> 02:48.840
But he did hint

37
02:48.870 --> 02:50.530
that I couldn't be president.

38
02:52.190 --> 02:53.079
So I had to pick someone

39
02:53.079 --> 02:54.610
I could keep under control.

40
02:55.400 --> 02:57.600
I needed to secure that position first.

41
02:58.000 --> 02:58.800
You...

42
02:59.240 --> 03:01.300
You really don't mince words, do you?

43
03:02.000 --> 03:03.870
Okay, I'm easy to manage.

44
03:04.150 --> 03:05.680
I'll do whatever you say.

45
03:05.870 --> 03:06.590
You know

46
03:06.590 --> 03:08.310
why I didn't pick Tong or the others?

47
03:08.310 --> 03:11.240
Because I'm deeply attached to Xiaoximen Hospital.

48
03:11.430 --> 03:13.150
They're just as attached to it.

49
03:13.150 --> 03:14.550
Well, then I have no idea.

50
03:19.590 --> 03:21.710
Because you're a laid-back kind of guy.

51
03:21.710 --> 03:22.400
What?

52
03:22.470 --> 03:23.960
You know how to avoid trouble.

53
03:23.960 --> 03:24.750
That's true.

54
03:28.240 --> 03:31.040
Once all the people appointed by the group arrive,

55
03:31.310 --> 03:32.310
the hospital

56
03:32.310 --> 03:33.470
will inevitably split into two camps:

57
03:33.470 --> 03:35.130
the locals and the outsiders.

58
03:38.000 --> 03:41.600
When a powerful newcomer clashes with the local establishment,

59
03:42.470 --> 03:43.800
they're bound

60
03:43.800 --> 03:46.000
to fight over every little advantage.

61
03:46.240 --> 03:47.590
Caught in the middle,

62
03:47.590 --> 03:49.430
you'll have an even harder time than you do now.

63
03:49.430 --> 03:50.630
That's a tough one.

64
03:51.400 --> 03:53.280
But as long as you stay calm,

65
03:54.030 --> 03:56.079
don't worry too much about personal gains or losses,

66
03:56.079 --> 03:57.630
and don't favor either side,

67
03:57.630 --> 04:00.830
you'll be the perfect candidate for hospital president.

68
04:00.870 --> 04:02.520
Why does this sound

69
04:03.120 --> 04:04.470
more and more suspicious the longer you talk?

70
04:04.470 --> 04:05.520
Wasn't I just a placeholder?

71
04:05.520 --> 04:06.630
I'm just a temp,

72
04:06.630 --> 04:07.840
filling in until they find someone permanent.

73
04:07.840 --> 04:09.370
That was the original plan.

74
04:10.280 --> 04:11.910
But leave a temporary appointment in place long enough,

75
04:10.320 --> 04:12.470
[President's Office]

76
04:11.910 --> 04:14.440
and doesn't it eventually become permanent?

77
04:14.470 --> 04:16.480
Why won't you let Che Mingming come back?

78
04:16.480 --> 04:17.190
Ask him.

79
04:17.190 --> 04:18.870
It was all his idea.

80
04:20.190 --> 04:22.450
Why won't you let Che Mingming come back?

81
04:22.680 --> 04:24.080
She wants to pursue a PhD.

82
04:25.040 --> 04:26.310
She's met

83
04:26.310 --> 04:27.570
all the requirements,

84
04:28.830 --> 04:30.070
but she's just a little short

85
04:30.070 --> 04:31.600
of excelling in every area.

86
04:31.830 --> 04:33.430
So I decided to cut off her fallback option

87
04:33.430 --> 04:34.630
and push her to give it everything she's got.

88
04:34.630 --> 04:35.830
Nothing left to lose.

89
04:37.430 --> 04:39.040
If she still doesn't get in,

90
04:39.720 --> 04:42.190
President Huang will take her back.

91
04:42.870 --> 04:44.330
Anything wrong with that?

92
04:45.360 --> 04:46.760
Nothing wrong with that.

93
04:47.040 --> 04:49.100
Anything else, Chief Physician Liu?

94
04:56.680 --> 04:57.480
Liu really

95
04:57.480 --> 04:58.950
is quite a character.

96
04:59.360 --> 05:00.870
P-People like him

97
05:00.870 --> 05:01.930
are hard to come by.

98
05:02.920 --> 05:04.120
If he didn't have any character flaws,

99
05:04.120 --> 05:06.380
would he still be at Xiaoximen Hospital?

100
05:06.480 --> 05:08.540
It's all about finding the right fit.

101
05:08.950 --> 05:11.950
Just like you being the right fit for hospital president.

102
05:11.950 --> 05:14.600
I... I don't want to be hospital president.

103
05:15.360 --> 05:17.420
I can't handle sitting in that chair.

104
05:17.700 --> 05:21.830
[Security Department]

105
05:21.160 --> 05:22.600
Mom, with cooking like yours,

106
05:21.920 --> 05:25.280
[999 Cold Medicine]

107
05:23.190 --> 05:25.000
it'd be a crime not to open a restaurant!

108
05:25.000 --> 05:26.480
This pickled cabbage filling

109
05:26.480 --> 05:27.270
is out of this world.

110
05:27.270 --> 05:28.040
Seriously,

111
05:28.070 --> 05:30.240
I could eat it for the rest of my life and never get tired of it.

112
05:30.240 --> 05:32.100
I'll make a bigger batch next time

113
05:32.390 --> 05:34.240
and bring some over for you, Xue,

114
05:34.270 --> 05:35.670
and your father-in-law.

115
05:38.800 --> 05:39.510
Set it aside

116
05:39.560 --> 05:40.240
and let it cool a bit.

117
05:40.240 --> 05:41.100
Drink it later.

118
05:41.830 --> 05:42.480
It's fine.

119
05:43.510 --> 05:44.510
Put something on.

120
05:44.680 --> 05:45.630
Don't get ahead of yourself.

121
05:45.630 --> 05:46.190
Have one.

122
05:46.190 --> 05:46.920
Look at that runny nose!

123
05:46.920 --> 05:47.920
Come on, just eat.

124
05:49.270 --> 05:50.830
You should head home and get some sleep.

125
05:50.830 --> 05:51.630
No rush.

126
05:51.920 --> 05:52.600
It's getting late.

127
05:52.600 --> 05:53.600
I've got some good news

128
05:53.600 --> 05:54.680
to share with you.

129
05:57.680 --> 05:58.480
Good news?

130
05:59.630 --> 06:02.630
You know how I've spent year after year fighting for justice,

131
06:02.630 --> 06:04.720
only to be talked out of it every time?

132
06:05.190 --> 06:07.590
Well, they thought it was too much trouble,

133
06:08.160 --> 06:10.600
so they asked someone to help negotiate a settlement

134
06:10.600 --> 06:11.730
and clear things up.

135
06:14.270 --> 06:15.190
I agreed.

136
06:15.600 --> 06:18.260
I'm not going to keep pushing the issue anymore.

137
06:18.510 --> 06:19.920
Back when Director Li

138
06:19.920 --> 06:21.480
offered you all that money, you turned him down

139
06:21.480 --> 06:23.140
and fought him tooth and nail.

140
06:24.000 --> 06:25.120
And now you've suddenly had a change of heart?

141
06:25.120 --> 06:27.360
That was just him trying to buy me off.

142
06:27.600 --> 06:30.040
This time, they're willing to talk things through and clear everything up.

143
06:30.040 --> 06:31.190
I don't trust him.

144
06:31.430 --> 06:32.760
I trust the government.

145
06:34.190 --> 06:36.000
As long as you can find peace with it, that's all that matters.

146
06:36.000 --> 06:37.330
Money isn't important.

147
06:38.040 --> 06:39.640
We've been saving for years,

148
06:39.680 --> 06:40.750
and we've got

149
06:41.800 --> 06:42.920
50,000 yuan now.

150
06:43.510 --> 06:46.310
That should be enough for your bride price, right?

151
06:48.310 --> 06:49.560
Uncle Gong said he doesn't want a bride price.

152
06:49.560 --> 06:51.070
He may not demand one,

153
06:51.510 --> 06:53.040
but we should still give it.

154
06:54.159 --> 06:55.920
If your father-in-law won't accept it,

155
06:55.920 --> 06:57.560
save it for Xue.

156
06:57.800 --> 06:59.600
Let her decide what to do with it.

157
07:05.800 --> 07:06.190
Mom,

158
07:06.190 --> 07:08.560
is this why you finally agreed to stop fighting for justice?

159
07:08.560 --> 07:10.040
No.

160
07:10.600 --> 07:12.270
I'm getting old.

161
07:14.390 --> 07:16.450
I can't run around fighting anymore.

162
07:16.720 --> 07:18.160
In another couple of years,

163
07:18.160 --> 07:19.560
am I supposed to go around

164
07:19.560 --> 07:21.560
in a wheelchair demanding justice?

165
07:22.600 --> 07:23.600
I've done enough.

166
07:24.870 --> 07:26.000
It's time to stop.

167
07:26.240 --> 07:26.920
Mom,

168
07:26.920 --> 07:28.600
don't talk like that.

169
07:29.070 --> 07:31.600
What happened to me has nothing to do with you.

170
07:32.920 --> 07:34.480
Your quilt is way too thin.

171
07:34.480 --> 07:35.390
That won't do.

172
07:36.360 --> 07:37.159
I'll ask

173
07:37.270 --> 07:38.159
Nie to make you

174
07:38.800 --> 07:40.560
a thicker one.

175
07:41.600 --> 07:42.600
I'm heading home.

176
07:42.800 --> 07:45.940
[Security Department]

177
08:03.040 --> 08:05.440
Chief Physician Liu! Chief Physician Liu!

178
08:05.830 --> 08:06.680
Chief Physician Liu!

179
08:06.680 --> 08:07.950
We've got a burn victim

180
08:07.950 --> 08:09.210
in the emergency room.

181
08:10.000 --> 08:10.830
An electrical appliance caught fire

182
08:10.830 --> 08:12.480
and set the whole house ablaze.

183
08:12.480 --> 08:13.830
He's suffered burns over 20% of his body.

184
08:13.830 --> 08:15.040
All the doctors in the burn unit

185
08:15.040 --> 08:16.100
have been laid off,

186
08:16.130 --> 08:17.020
[Dirty Utility Room]

187
08:16.190 --> 08:17.270
and the general surgeon on duty

188
08:17.270 --> 08:18.000
has never

189
08:18.000 --> 08:19.400
handled a case like this.

190
08:33.510 --> 08:34.150
Jia Xin.

191
08:34.200 --> 08:35.510
Blood pressure: 90 over 50.

192
08:35.510 --> 08:36.909
Oxygen saturation: 98%.

193
08:37.240 --> 08:38.320
Heart rate: 131.

194
08:38.549 --> 08:39.870
Infuse 500 milliliters

195
08:39.870 --> 08:40.600
of lactated Ringer's solution

196
08:40.600 --> 08:41.530
intravenously.

197
08:41.720 --> 08:43.240
Get blood samples ready for testing.

198
08:43.240 --> 08:44.870
Insert a urinary catheter and monitor urine output.

199
08:44.870 --> 08:46.530
Get me some povidone-iodine.

200
08:53.550 --> 08:54.840
Jia Xin, bear with me.

201
08:55.240 --> 08:57.750
I'll disinfect the burn wounds with povidone-iodine first.

202
08:57.750 --> 08:59.080
Prepare to treat the blisters.

203
08:59.080 --> 09:02.320
I'll puncture the blisters at their lowest point and drain them with a syringe.

204
09:02.320 --> 09:03.440
Don't move.

205
09:03.480 --> 09:04.270
Hold still.

206
09:04.550 --> 09:06.000
Here, hold his hand down for me.

207
09:06.000 --> 09:07.330
Don't move. Don't move.

208
09:07.790 --> 09:08.920
Jia Xin, stay still.

209
09:10.670 --> 09:12.670
It hurts! It hurts! It hurts!

210
09:13.200 --> 09:14.930
Change gloves. Drape the area.

211
09:17.510 --> 09:19.710
Get me some silver sulfadiazine cream.

212
09:25.000 --> 09:26.000
I'm dying!

213
09:26.030 --> 09:26.960
I'm dying!

214
09:26.960 --> 09:27.480
Jia Xin.

215
09:28.030 --> 09:29.230
Think about your mom.

216
09:41.960 --> 09:42.670
Chief Physician Liu,

217
09:42.670 --> 09:44.150
his blood pressure is now 120 over 80.

218
09:44.150 --> 09:45.390
Oxygen saturation is 98%.

219
09:45.390 --> 09:46.320
Heart rate is 85.

220
09:55.790 --> 09:56.670
Chief Physician Liu,

221
09:56.670 --> 09:58.120
this is the patient's mother.

222
09:57.420 --> 10:01.110
[Emergency Department Lobby Ahead]

223
09:58.630 --> 09:59.960
I know. I know her.

224
09:59.960 --> 10:00.750
You go take care of your other duties.

225
10:00.750 --> 10:01.390
Okay.

226
10:01.170 --> 10:05.140
[No Entry]

227
10:01.550 --> 10:02.360
Auntie Duan,

228
10:02.750 --> 10:03.550
don't worry.

229
10:03.600 --> 10:04.390
Jia Xin's condition

230
10:04.390 --> 10:05.440
is stable now.

231
10:06.870 --> 10:07.840
Dr. Liu,

232
10:08.600 --> 10:11.000
just seeing you puts my mind at ease.

233
10:13.120 --> 10:16.030
There's 38,000 yuan on this card.

234
10:17.200 --> 10:18.270
I'm old,

235
10:18.510 --> 10:20.840
and sometimes I'm awfully slow to catch on.

236
10:20.840 --> 10:21.720
I don't always

237
10:21.720 --> 10:23.520
understand what people tell me,

238
10:24.150 --> 10:26.750
and I'm afraid that could delay his treatment.

239
10:26.840 --> 10:28.240
I trust you, so I'd like you

240
10:28.240 --> 10:29.570
to hold on to this money.

241
10:30.390 --> 10:31.960
Please use the best medicine

242
10:31.960 --> 10:34.290
and do whatever it takes to get my son well.

243
10:35.630 --> 10:36.600
Well, I...

244
10:37.630 --> 10:39.120
Please help me out.

245
10:42.910 --> 10:44.110
All right, all right.

246
10:45.270 --> 10:46.720
Here's what we'll do, Auntie Duan.

247
10:46.720 --> 10:48.080
Just write down the card's PIN for me.

248
10:48.080 --> 10:49.600
I'll keep all the receipts for every expense

249
10:49.600 --> 10:50.840
and give them to you afterward.

250
10:50.840 --> 10:51.720
Thank you.

251
10:51.750 --> 10:52.630
Thank you.

252
11:00.840 --> 11:01.480
Doctor,

253
11:01.480 --> 11:02.390
how is he doing?

254
11:02.480 --> 11:04.840
His condition is relatively stable for now,

255
11:04.840 --> 11:06.900
but treatment will be a long process,

256
11:07.000 --> 11:10.130
and dressing changes will be extremely painful for him.

257
11:11.630 --> 11:13.030
I know my son.

258
11:13.840 --> 11:16.870
He's always been an optimist, ever since he was little.

259
11:16.870 --> 11:18.120
He'll get through this.

260
11:18.120 --> 11:18.910
On top

261
11:18.910 --> 11:20.510
of the unbearable physical pain,

262
11:20.510 --> 11:22.320
he'll also have to cope with

263
11:22.320 --> 11:23.960
the psychological trauma caused by the changes to his face.

264
11:23.960 --> 11:25.360
Right now, we need to pay close attention

265
11:25.360 --> 11:26.630
to his emotional state

266
11:26.720 --> 11:28.150
and make sure he doesn't do anything drastic.

267
11:28.150 --> 11:30.630
We should arrange for as many people as possible to take turns staying with him.

268
11:30.630 --> 11:32.080
We have only each other at home.

269
11:32.080 --> 11:34.120
I... I can manage on my own.

270
11:42.120 --> 11:43.030
Jia Xin,

271
11:45.960 --> 11:46.790
Jia Xin.

272
11:49.390 --> 11:56.460
♪ It's only after something is lost that we begin to see ♪

273
11:49.840 --> 11:50.910
Hang in there, son.

274
11:51.840 --> 11:52.720
Hang in there.

275
11:55.960 --> 11:57.030
Okay, okay.

276
11:58.350 --> 12:04.090
♪ But some things can never be undone ♪

277
12:05.870 --> 12:07.120
It hurts so much.

278
12:07.090 --> 12:13.730
♪ When snowflakes cover all our yesterdays ♪

279
12:10.870 --> 12:11.630
Miss,

280
12:12.070 --> 12:16.120
[Malatang Hot Pot]

281
12:12.360 --> 12:14.000
you've been sitting here all night

282
12:14.000 --> 12:14.960
without even eating.

283
12:14.960 --> 12:16.200
Are you waiting for someone?

284
12:15.110 --> 12:20.920
♪ Perhaps it's best we leave the words unsaid ♪

285
12:17.440 --> 12:19.360
Duan and her son, perhaps?

286
12:20.750 --> 12:21.750
Yes.

287
12:22.390 --> 12:23.850
Have you seen them lately?

288
12:24.870 --> 12:26.440
I heard a while ago

289
12:24.910 --> 12:32.130
♪ We were once someone else ♪

290
12:26.670 --> 12:28.320
that Duan had decided to let it go

291
12:28.320 --> 12:29.750
and stop fighting for justice.

292
12:29.750 --> 12:31.000
Easy, easy.

293
12:31.080 --> 12:33.030
Maybe the two of them

294
12:33.080 --> 12:34.550
have gone away for a change of scenery.

295
12:33.690 --> 12:39.880
♪ Then, one day, we found our truest selves ♪

296
12:34.960 --> 12:35.750
Girl,

297
12:35.840 --> 12:36.900
it's cold out here.

298
12:36.910 --> 12:38.510
Come inside and warm up a bit.

299
12:39.240 --> 12:40.200
I'm fine, ma'am.

300
12:40.200 --> 12:41.030
Please carry on with what you were doing.

301
12:41.030 --> 12:42.030
Don't mind me.

302
12:42.690 --> 12:49.600
♪ Turns out, you don't have to fall apart ♪

303
12:50.370 --> 12:57.960
♪ To deserve a fresh start ♪

304
12:56.050 --> 13:04.190
[Radiology Department] [Isolation Ward] [Burn Department, 1st Floor]

305
13:00.550 --> 13:07.340
♪ Not every goodbye is meant to erase the past ♪

306
13:04.710 --> 13:05.820
[Security Department]

307
13:05.820 --> 13:15.340
[Fire Prevention Is Everyone's Responsibility. Keep Safety in Mind.]

308
13:09.380 --> 13:16.200
♪ At least we met with open hearts ♪

309
13:16.120 --> 13:16.910
Excuse me.

310
13:17.270 --> 13:18.480
Can I help you, miss?

311
13:17.900 --> 13:20.890
♪ When life stretches on for so long ♪

312
13:18.750 --> 13:20.630
Do you know where Jia Xin went?

313
13:20.870 --> 13:22.080
I'm new here.

314
13:21.620 --> 13:25.300
♪ Not every story needs a perfect ending ♪

315
13:22.080 --> 13:23.940
I don't know anyone named Jia Xin.

316
13:26.020 --> 13:34.050
♪ Maybe walking side by side for a while is enough ♪

317
13:27.150 --> 13:28.350
It's okay. Thank you.

318
13:29.480 --> 13:30.390
Take care.

319
13:42.630 --> 13:43.270
Please look after him for me

320
13:43.270 --> 13:44.840
while you're there.

321
13:44.050 --> 13:46.000
[Civilized Fucheng]

322
13:45.750 --> 13:46.240
Don't mention it.

323
13:46.240 --> 13:47.510
You can rest easy.

324
13:48.000 --> 13:49.130
I've got it covered.

325
13:49.200 --> 13:51.000
Sometimes, when it comes to family...

326
13:51.000 --> 13:52.120
Do your parents know

327
13:52.120 --> 13:53.360
about my dad's condition?

328
13:52.930 --> 13:56.990
[Drinking Water]

329
13:54.030 --> 13:54.840
No.

330
13:54.840 --> 13:56.500
I haven't told them anything.

331
13:57.200 --> 13:59.400
Don't you think that's a little unwise?

332
13:59.840 --> 14:01.080
What are you worried about?

333
14:01.080 --> 14:02.670
You don't need to worry about a thing.

334
14:02.670 --> 14:05.130
Uncle Che and I get along like a house on fire.

335
14:07.240 --> 14:08.240
Rest assured,

336
14:08.240 --> 14:10.240
I'll live up to the organization's expectations

337
14:10.240 --> 14:11.550
and bring Uncle Che back safe and sound.

338
14:11.550 --> 14:12.600
Can you stop acting up, especially

339
14:12.600 --> 14:14.260
with your parents right here?

340
14:14.510 --> 14:16.030
Yes, Commissioner Che.

341
14:17.720 --> 14:18.440
What,

342
14:18.440 --> 14:19.970
are we on the same level now?

343
14:21.840 --> 14:23.570
Sorry, leader. I overstepped.

344
14:24.600 --> 14:25.480
Cut the crap.

345
14:26.360 --> 14:27.510
Go inside already. It's here.

346
14:27.510 --> 14:28.320
Dad, we're here.

347
14:28.320 --> 14:29.960
Uncle Che, here is the ticket gate.

348
14:29.960 --> 14:31.240
-We're leaving, Mom and Dad. -Keep your ID card somewhere safe.

349
14:31.240 --> 14:32.550
-Take good care of yourself, son. -Remember what I told you.

350
14:32.550 --> 14:33.550
Call us anytime.

351
14:36.550 --> 14:37.320
Junnan,

352
14:37.750 --> 14:39.080
take good care of my dad.

353
14:39.840 --> 14:40.840
And look after yourself, too.

354
14:40.840 --> 14:41.630
Don't worry.

355
14:41.870 --> 14:43.120
Consider it done.

356
14:44.200 --> 14:44.960
Director Chen.

357
14:44.960 --> 14:46.510
Have a safe trip, Mr. Che.

358
14:46.510 --> 14:47.120
All right, all right.

359
14:47.120 --> 14:47.910
You two head home.

360
14:47.910 --> 14:48.360
-Take... -Bye-bye.

361
14:48.360 --> 14:49.870
Take good care of Uncle Che.

362
14:49.870 --> 14:50.960
I'll send you photos

363
14:50.960 --> 14:52.080
and videos.

364
14:52.240 --> 14:53.440
Do you think our son

365
14:53.440 --> 14:54.960
is ready for this new chapter in his life?

366
14:54.960 --> 14:55.840
Clearly not.

367
14:55.840 --> 14:57.360
-But this is a start... -Uncle, Auntie,

368
14:57.360 --> 14:58.670
um, I'd better get going.

369
14:58.670 --> 14:59.480
I'll give you a ride.

370
14:59.480 --> 14:59.840
No, no, it's fine.

371
14:59.840 --> 15:01.320
The bus is really convenient for me.

372
15:01.320 --> 15:02.550
Well, we're going the same way anyway.

373
15:02.550 --> 15:03.550
Um, Chen,

374
15:03.550 --> 15:04.550
weren't you in a hurry to get to work?

375
15:04.550 --> 15:04.840
Yes.

376
15:04.840 --> 15:05.550
You go ahead and drive back.

377
15:05.550 --> 15:06.390
We'll take the bus.

378
15:06.390 --> 15:07.750
Don't rush off just yet.

379
15:07.750 --> 15:08.960
What if... what if

380
15:08.960 --> 15:10.290
she has something to do?

381
15:10.550 --> 15:11.150
Miss,

382
15:11.150 --> 15:12.550
maybe we could meet again sometime?

383
15:12.550 --> 15:13.120
Sure.

384
15:13.120 --> 15:14.980
Well, goodbye, Uncle and Auntie.

385
15:15.120 --> 15:16.360
Take care!

386
15:16.760 --> 15:21.720
[Radiology Department] [Isolation Ward] [Burn Department, 1st Floor]

387
15:22.320 --> 15:24.390
-It's okay, it's okay. You're all right. -What's wrong? Are you feeling unwell?

388
15:24.390 --> 15:25.600
He had a nightmare.

389
15:25.910 --> 15:28.570
Bed two, Jia Xin. Time for your dressing change.

390
15:28.910 --> 15:29.550
Mom.

391
15:30.240 --> 15:31.570
No, no. Don't change it.

392
15:31.630 --> 15:32.390
Please, don't.

393
15:32.390 --> 15:33.360
The medication he was prescribed

394
15:33.360 --> 15:34.960
should have some pain-relieving ingredients.

395
15:34.960 --> 15:37.160
He's taken them, but he's still in pain.

396
15:37.480 --> 15:39.390
He can't even sleep at night.

397
15:39.870 --> 15:40.870
Dr. Liu,

398
15:41.150 --> 15:42.080
could we

399
15:42.270 --> 15:44.030
wait a few more days before changing his dressing?

400
15:44.030 --> 15:44.600
I'm afraid not, ma'am.

401
15:44.600 --> 15:45.440
You need to follow the doctor's instructions

402
15:45.440 --> 15:46.150
and have the dressings changed on schedule.

403
15:46.150 --> 15:47.510
Otherwise, what if the wounds get infected?

404
15:47.510 --> 15:48.840
Don't be scared. Being afraid will only make it feel worse.

405
15:48.840 --> 15:50.030
No, no!

406
15:50.320 --> 15:51.910
Mom, it hurts too much.

407
15:52.270 --> 15:53.360
Don't change it.

408
15:53.360 --> 15:54.270
Please, just leave it alone.

409
15:54.270 --> 15:55.600
I know it hurts, my son.

410
15:56.200 --> 15:57.000
Just leave it alone.

411
15:57.000 --> 15:58.800
We have to push through the pain.

412
15:59.960 --> 16:00.670
I'll be as gentle as I can.

413
16:00.670 --> 16:02.550
Please, doctor. I'm begging you.

414
16:02.870 --> 16:04.480
It hurts so much. Please!

415
16:08.150 --> 16:08.750
Uncle Che.

416
16:13.300 --> 16:16.530
[Chen Junnan]

417
16:18.320 --> 16:19.480
You must be Mr. Wang.

418
16:19.510 --> 16:21.550
Are you Mr. Chen and Mr. Che?

419
16:21.550 --> 16:22.200
That's right.

420
16:22.200 --> 16:22.870
I'm a colleague

421
16:22.870 --> 16:23.630
of Manager Liu.

422
16:23.630 --> 16:24.960
I've come to pick you up.

423
16:25.200 --> 16:25.870
Manager Liu?

424
16:25.870 --> 16:27.120
Which Manager Liu?

425
16:27.120 --> 16:28.450
Y-You mean Zhengguang?

426
16:28.670 --> 16:29.600
Liu Zhengguang.

427
16:30.630 --> 16:31.960
Zhengguang's a manager now?

428
16:31.960 --> 16:33.490
Yes, yes. He's our manager.

429
16:33.630 --> 16:34.460
Hello. Nice to meet you.

430
16:34.460 --> 16:39.330
[Guomao Bridge]

431
16:36.120 --> 16:36.870
Standing

432
16:38.600 --> 16:40.460
on the banks of the Lancang River,

433
16:40.790 --> 16:42.990
I always wished I could fill a washbasin

434
16:43.600 --> 16:46.030
with its surging waves.

435
16:47.840 --> 16:49.360
Then one morning,

436
16:49.670 --> 16:51.440
after the waters had receded,

437
16:52.750 --> 16:55.440
I saw the rocks studded with pearls.

438
16:58.720 --> 17:00.480
They were the moons

439
17:01.630 --> 17:03.550
the river had failed to carry away

440
17:05.349 --> 17:06.349
the night before.

441
17:08.240 --> 17:09.030
Uncle Che,

442
17:09.270 --> 17:10.530
what a beautiful poem!

443
17:13.589 --> 17:14.400
Junnan.

444
17:19.030 --> 17:20.510
Look at you, all dressed up in your black suit and leather shoes.

445
17:20.510 --> 17:22.109
You've really smartened up!

446
17:22.349 --> 17:23.200
Let me introduce you.

447
17:23.200 --> 17:24.200
This is Uncle Che.

448
17:24.480 --> 17:25.480
Hello, Uncle Che.

449
17:26.109 --> 17:26.920
You must be the liaison

450
17:26.920 --> 17:28.270
from the Beijing station.

451
17:28.270 --> 17:28.880
I know.

452
17:30.110 --> 17:30.840
Zhengguang.

453
17:31.000 --> 17:31.930
Liu Zhengguang.

454
17:32.200 --> 17:32.550
That's me.

455
17:32.550 --> 17:33.440
Xiaobo, right?

456
17:33.750 --> 17:34.480
Liu Zhengguang.

457
17:34.480 --> 17:35.550
Just call him Zhengguang.

458
17:35.550 --> 17:35.790
Right, right.

459
17:35.790 --> 17:36.200
Come on, have a seat.

460
17:36.200 --> 17:36.960
Time to eat, Uncle Che.

461
17:36.960 --> 17:38.160
Comrade Zhengguang, you've been working hard.

462
17:38.160 --> 17:38.880
-Oh, not at all. Not at all. -You've really gone to a lot of trouble.

463
17:38.880 --> 17:39.680
It's nothing.

464
17:40.480 --> 17:41.740
Have a seat, Uncle Che.

465
17:42.200 --> 17:43.240
You've got things

466
17:44.030 --> 17:45.880
pretty well arranged here.

467
17:48.350 --> 17:49.830
Now tell me, what's going on?

468
17:49.830 --> 17:50.680
A little luck,

469
17:50.680 --> 17:52.810
and a little help from Liu Zhengliang.

470
17:59.200 --> 18:00.400
What brings you here?

471
18:01.000 --> 18:01.790
Boss,

472
18:02.200 --> 18:04.000
everyone back at the station sends their regards.

473
18:04.000 --> 18:05.660
I came to see how you're doing.

474
18:06.510 --> 18:07.480
Leave the stuff

475
18:07.550 --> 18:08.350
and go.

476
18:09.160 --> 18:09.960
All right.

477
18:10.110 --> 18:10.790
You didn't

478
18:10.790 --> 18:12.050
have to bring all this.

479
18:13.110 --> 18:14.370
I'll be off then, Boss.

480
18:15.510 --> 18:16.230
Wait.

481
18:18.310 --> 18:19.720
Don't think saving my life

482
18:19.720 --> 18:21.270
gives you any special privileges.

483
18:21.270 --> 18:23.200
I'm not going to treat you any differently because of it.

484
18:23.200 --> 18:24.930
That's fine. Whatever you say.

485
18:24.960 --> 18:26.350
As long as you stay healthy

486
18:26.350 --> 18:27.160
and don't end up back in the hospital,

487
18:27.160 --> 18:28.560
that's all that matters.

488
18:29.550 --> 18:30.410
Go on, get back.

489
18:32.590 --> 18:33.990
Take care on your way out.

490
18:46.070 --> 18:47.000
Liu Zhengguang!

491
18:47.590 --> 18:48.790
Liu Zhengguang!

492
18:50.750 --> 18:51.550
Who is it?

493
18:52.510 --> 18:54.270
The man who's offering you a job.

494
18:54.270 --> 18:55.550
I don't even know you.

495
18:55.920 --> 18:57.050
Get in the car first.

496
18:57.350 --> 18:59.480
We'll get acquainted after you get in.

497
19:01.110 --> 19:02.440
I've known Wu

498
19:02.640 --> 19:03.830
for years,

499
19:04.110 --> 19:06.200
and this is the first time he's ever asked me for a favor.

500
19:06.200 --> 19:08.270
He called me out of the blue

501
19:08.440 --> 19:10.170
and put in a strong word for you.

502
19:11.110 --> 19:12.750
As it happens, my driver

503
19:12.750 --> 19:14.950
just quit and went back to his hometown.

504
19:15.440 --> 19:17.920
How about staying on and working as my driver?

505
19:17.920 --> 19:19.320
Would you be interested?

506
19:23.640 --> 19:24.480
Later, I found out

507
19:24.480 --> 19:26.070
my current boss's surname was Zheng.

508
19:26.070 --> 19:28.870
He and Boss Wu had served in the military together.

509
19:29.830 --> 19:31.200
But everyone

510
19:31.200 --> 19:32.260
calls you Manager.

511
19:33.160 --> 19:34.920
Well, besides driving for the boss,

512
19:34.920 --> 19:36.270
I'm also learning the ropes in the hotel's

513
19:36.270 --> 19:37.330
sales department.

514
19:38.160 --> 19:39.240
We've got

515
19:39.350 --> 19:40.310
one sales manager

516
19:40.310 --> 19:41.680
and seven deputy managers in the sales department.

517
19:41.680 --> 19:42.550
They're all managers anyway,

518
19:42.550 --> 19:43.270
so we basically

519
19:43.270 --> 19:44.600
call everyone Manager.

520
19:46.400 --> 19:47.200
I hope

521
19:48.920 --> 19:49.880
every kind-hearted person

522
19:49.880 --> 19:51.200
gets as lucky as you.

523
20:35.350 --> 20:36.550
Chief Physician Liu.

524
20:39.440 --> 20:41.730
[Wishing You a Speedy Recovery]

525
20:41.730 --> 20:44.300
[Beware of medical scammers. Don't be fooled.]

526
20:54.880 --> 20:57.400
[Ward 1]

527
21:01.310 --> 21:04.690
[No Smoking Area]

528
21:05.050 --> 21:06.430
[Quiet]

529
21:13.850 --> 21:14.660
[Restroom]

530
21:14.760 --> 21:15.360
[Friendly Reminder]

531
21:15.380 --> 21:16.770
[Please do not dispose of toilet paper or sanitary products]

532
21:16.800 --> 21:19.580
[in the squat toilet, as this may cause blockages.]

533
21:19.600 --> 21:20.260
[Squat Toilet]

534
21:20.590 --> 21:21.510
[Seated Toilet]

535
21:21.510 --> 21:21.840
[Squat Toilet]

536
21:21.930 --> 21:22.460
[Seated Toilet]

537
21:26.240 --> 21:27.030
Jia Xin.

538
21:29.920 --> 21:30.720
Jia Xin.

539
21:31.240 --> 21:32.270
Are you in there?

540
21:34.680 --> 21:35.510
Jia Xin.

541
21:35.790 --> 21:36.590
Jia Xin!

542
21:41.680 --> 21:42.510
Zhengliang.

543
21:43.640 --> 21:44.900
Don't come any closer.

544
21:45.270 --> 21:46.270
Give me the knife.

545
21:47.920 --> 21:49.480
L-Listen to me.

546
21:50.960 --> 21:52.160
Your life is your own.

547
21:52.920 --> 21:53.920
Whether you

548
21:54.160 --> 21:55.350
live or die,

549
21:55.350 --> 21:56.310
it's up to you.

550
21:57.160 --> 21:58.890
But even if you're going to die,

551
21:59.070 --> 21:59.960
shouldn't we at least

552
21:59.960 --> 22:01.160
talk through

553
22:01.160 --> 22:01.960
whatever's weighing on your mind first?

554
22:01.960 --> 22:03.350
It hurts so much.

555
22:04.480 --> 22:05.920
I can't take it anymore.

556
22:05.920 --> 22:06.310
I know.

557
22:06.310 --> 22:07.510
I know you're in pain.

558
22:07.590 --> 22:08.200
But give me the knife first.

559
22:08.200 --> 22:10.070
I'm going to be crippled for the rest of my life.

560
22:10.070 --> 22:11.510
I'll never get better.

561
22:12.680 --> 22:13.680
You're not me.

562
22:14.240 --> 22:15.880
You don't know what it's like.

563
22:15.880 --> 22:17.160
My face is ruined.

564
22:17.880 --> 22:19.550
I'll never recover.

565
22:19.830 --> 22:20.680
I'm ruined!

566
22:20.680 --> 22:22.640
You're not ruined! It can be treated.

567
22:22.640 --> 22:24.030
It can all be treated.

568
22:24.480 --> 22:25.270
Trust me.

569
22:25.920 --> 22:26.960
Everyone

570
22:27.480 --> 22:29.740
is doing everything they can to help you.

571
22:29.960 --> 22:30.830
But you have to

572
22:30.830 --> 22:32.470
keep fighting, okay?

573
22:33.590 --> 22:36.480
-Give me the knife. -How am I supposed to hang in there?

574
22:36.480 --> 22:39.280
My mom can't even afford to get her stones treated.

575
22:40.000 --> 22:42.720
I'm nothing but a burden to her now.

576
22:42.720 --> 22:43.440
No.

577
22:43.440 --> 22:44.680
Your mom told me

578
22:45.070 --> 22:47.070
you were always so optimistic growing up.

579
22:47.070 --> 22:50.160
-She believes in you, and so do I. -What good is being optimistic?

580
22:50.160 --> 22:50.960
Can it make me

581
22:50.960 --> 22:52.510
look the way I used to

582
22:52.920 --> 22:54.780
and let me live with some dignity?

583
22:56.030 --> 22:57.680
My mom has sacrificed

584
22:57.680 --> 22:59.160
her whole life for me.

585
23:00.000 --> 23:02.070
I'm nothing but a useless wreck now.

586
23:02.270 --> 23:03.070
Jia Xin.

587
23:06.000 --> 23:07.270
If you die, it'll all be over for you.

588
23:07.270 --> 23:08.600
But what about your mom?

589
23:09.400 --> 23:10.270
She's getting on in years.

590
23:10.270 --> 23:12.070
Do you really want to leave her all alone?

591
23:12.070 --> 23:13.750
I want to live, too.

592
23:14.350 --> 23:15.720
But how?

593
23:16.070 --> 23:18.000
How am I supposed to live like this?

594
23:24.960 --> 23:26.560
The other day, on my way home,

595
23:28.440 --> 23:29.840
I was sitting in a vehicle

596
23:31.550 --> 23:34.150
when I saw a makeshift shelter by the roadside.

597
23:37.440 --> 23:39.500
You and your mom were sitting inside.

598
23:49.920 --> 23:50.720
Jia Xin,

599
23:52.680 --> 23:53.960
I really envy you.

600
23:58.030 --> 23:58.590
I do.

601
24:28.680 --> 24:29.510
It's okay.

602
24:31.440 --> 24:32.640
It can all be treated.

603
24:33.880 --> 24:36.210
Things will get better, little by little.

604
24:38.350 --> 24:39.160
Zhengliang.

605
24:42.110 --> 24:44.110
Can you please not tell my mom?

606
24:47.640 --> 24:49.400
I don't want her to worry.

607
25:07.720 --> 25:08.920
What's wrong?

608
25:09.830 --> 25:11.000
Are you in a bad mood?

609
25:12.790 --> 25:14.680
I have a patient with severe burns.

610
25:14.680 --> 25:16.410
He's a friend of Zhengguang's.

611
25:16.830 --> 25:17.750
He tried to kill himself,

612
25:17.750 --> 25:19.150
but I managed to save him.

613
25:19.400 --> 25:21.460
I'm still worried he might try again.

614
25:43.110 --> 25:43.880
Kid,

615
25:44.590 --> 25:46.640
I heard you're bored.

616
25:47.110 --> 25:49.110
So, uh, Xiaozhu

617
25:49.110 --> 25:50.350
brought all kinds of games:

618
25:50.350 --> 25:51.590
Chinese military chess, Chinese chess, checkers,

619
25:51.590 --> 25:52.590
and Gomoku.

620
25:52.590 --> 25:54.200
Whatever you feel like playing, we'll play.

621
25:54.200 --> 25:55.030
And if you're still bored,

622
25:55.030 --> 25:56.200
we can just sit and chat.

623
25:56.200 --> 25:56.640
How's that?

624
25:56.640 --> 25:57.720
Forget chatting.

625
25:57.720 --> 25:58.550
If you want a drink,

626
25:58.550 --> 25:59.720
I'll even,

627
25:59.720 --> 26:00.240
you know...

628
26:00.240 --> 26:02.300
He'll even have a few drinks with you.

629
26:02.680 --> 26:03.750
I can't have you guys

630
26:03.750 --> 26:05.440
keeping his company for nothing.

631
26:05.440 --> 26:07.590
I ought to show my appreciation somehow.

632
26:07.590 --> 26:08.550
Come on, don't say that.

633
26:08.550 --> 26:09.720
You're making it awkward.

634
26:09.720 --> 26:11.640
Bring some sunflower seeds, then.

635
26:11.640 --> 26:12.440
Sure.

636
26:15.270 --> 26:16.680
Everyone,

637
26:19.640 --> 26:20.970
why don't you head home?

638
26:22.070 --> 26:23.030
Look at him,

639
26:23.030 --> 26:24.200
being all polite.

640
26:24.200 --> 26:24.920
No,

641
26:25.350 --> 26:26.550
I'm not being polite.

642
26:27.440 --> 26:29.200
Mom, I want to see Zhengliang.

643
26:29.200 --> 26:29.790
Here.

644
26:29.790 --> 26:30.650
I'm right here.

645
26:31.550 --> 26:32.350
What's up?

646
26:32.680 --> 26:33.960
Are you itchy or in pain?

647
26:33.960 --> 26:34.790
Neither.

648
26:35.960 --> 26:37.420
I just wanted to thank you.

649
26:38.200 --> 26:39.260
Forget the thanks.

650
26:39.680 --> 26:40.550
Let me ask you something.

651
26:40.550 --> 26:42.350
If Liu Zhengguang and I ever get into an argument,

652
26:42.350 --> 26:43.310
whose side will you take?

653
26:43.310 --> 26:46.440
I'll take the side of whoever's right, of course.

654
26:49.200 --> 26:50.460
Can't argue with that.

655
26:52.640 --> 26:54.100
You're a pretty smart guy.

656
26:54.350 --> 26:55.160
Zhengliang,

657
26:56.350 --> 26:58.160
I need to ask you for a favor.

658
27:00.220 --> 27:01.970
[Construction Area. Do Not Climb Over.]

659
27:02.050 --> 27:03.430
[Gong's Blind Massage]

660
27:11.880 --> 27:12.680
Hello.

661
27:12.920 --> 27:13.590
Hello.

662
27:13.590 --> 27:15.110
What kind of service are you looking for?

663
27:15.110 --> 27:15.920
I'm not here for any of your services.

664
27:15.920 --> 27:16.510
I'm a doctor

665
27:16.510 --> 27:17.830
at Xiaoximen Hospital.

666
27:17.830 --> 27:19.230
I'm looking for Gong Xue.

667
27:20.270 --> 27:22.130
Sweetie, someone's here for you.

668
27:30.310 --> 27:31.000
Um,

669
27:31.000 --> 27:31.790
Jia Xin told me

670
27:31.790 --> 27:33.070
he owed you 3,000 yuan,

671
27:33.160 --> 27:35.090
and asked me to pay you back for him.

672
27:35.550 --> 27:36.640
Here's

673
27:37.310 --> 27:38.720
the 3,000 yuan in cash.

674
27:38.960 --> 27:40.160
Go ahead and count it.

675
27:41.880 --> 27:43.240
What's this all about?

676
27:44.550 --> 27:45.750
He just told me he owed you money

677
27:45.750 --> 27:46.880
and asked me to pay it back.

678
27:46.880 --> 27:48.480
He didn't say anything else.

679
27:50.270 --> 27:50.880
How could he

680
27:50.880 --> 27:52.510
not even want to see me?

681
27:54.240 --> 27:56.170
Sweetie, don't get upset just yet.

682
27:57.240 --> 27:58.100
How about this?

683
27:58.160 --> 27:59.200
Where is he?

684
27:59.200 --> 28:00.750
Take me to see him.

685
28:00.750 --> 28:01.790
Whatever's going on, I'll—

686
28:01.790 --> 28:02.440
Dad.

687
28:08.880 --> 28:09.750
Sir,

688
28:10.720 --> 28:12.380
please go back and tell Jia Xin

689
28:13.350 --> 28:15.640
that even if he doesn't want to see me anymore,

690
28:15.640 --> 28:17.370
he should tell me that himself.

691
28:17.510 --> 28:19.550
He can't just disappear like this.

692
28:21.160 --> 28:21.830
All right.

693
28:21.830 --> 28:23.760
I'll make sure he gets the message.

694
28:25.880 --> 28:26.270
Well,

695
28:26.270 --> 28:27.790
if the amount is correct,

696
28:27.830 --> 28:28.760
I'll be on my way.

697
28:39.070 --> 28:39.720
Sweetie, please,

698
28:39.720 --> 28:41.310
d-don't be mad.

699
28:43.640 --> 28:44.680
This is my fault.

700
28:45.960 --> 28:47.110
I misjudged him.

701
28:52.720 --> 28:53.480
Um,

702
28:52.760 --> 29:02.680
[Lounge]

703
28:53.920 --> 28:54.720
I'm sorry,

704
28:54.880 --> 28:55.750
Sir and Miss.

705
28:55.920 --> 28:57.980
I wasn't thinking straight just now.

706
28:58.240 --> 29:00.110
Do you know what condition

707
29:00.720 --> 29:01.720
Jia Xin is in now?

708
29:03.960 --> 29:04.750
Jia Xin.

709
29:05.720 --> 29:07.920
Jia Xin, what's with you paying me back?

710
29:08.000 --> 29:09.350
What do you take me for?

711
29:14.790 --> 29:16.160
I... I'm disfigured.

712
29:33.920 --> 29:34.720
Don't...

713
29:55.960 --> 29:57.760
What does that have to do with me?

714
29:58.480 --> 29:59.110
It's not like I can see

715
29:59.110 --> 30:00.510
what you look like.

716
30:00.640 --> 30:01.350
What,

717
30:01.350 --> 30:03.480
were you really that handsome before?

718
30:08.510 --> 30:09.310
Pretty much.

719
30:10.160 --> 30:11.640
Before I lost my sight,

720
30:12.200 --> 30:13.600
Andy Lau was my favorite.

721
30:14.270 --> 30:15.730
Are you as handsome as him?

722
30:16.030 --> 30:17.430
I'd say we're about even.

723
30:17.960 --> 30:18.830
Liar.

724
30:19.830 --> 30:21.070
You feel like a steamed bun,

725
30:21.070 --> 30:24.070
and you're telling me you were as handsome as Andy Lau?

726
30:26.310 --> 30:28.070
At least it feels nice to touch.

727
30:46.110 --> 30:46.920
Jia Xin.

728
30:47.350 --> 30:48.160
Here.

729
30:49.830 --> 30:50.720
When you

730
30:51.720 --> 30:52.830
get better,

731
30:53.640 --> 30:54.400
will you still

732
30:54.400 --> 30:55.680
read novels to me?

733
30:56.550 --> 30:58.410
You don't have to wait until then.

734
30:58.680 --> 31:00.140
I can read to you right now.

735
31:03.070 --> 31:06.920
Last time, we left off

736
31:08.750 --> 31:11.160
with Li Mochou and her disciple

737
31:12.160 --> 31:15.160
turning this little town upside down,

738
31:15.160 --> 31:19.110
throwing everything into chaos.

739
31:24.070 --> 31:27.640
Meanwhile, Yang Guo was lying peacefully

740
31:27.750 --> 31:29.070
on the same heated bed

741
31:29.070 --> 31:31.680
as Lu Wushuang.

742
31:35.200 --> 31:37.960
Lu Wushuang wondered to herself,

743
31:38.640 --> 31:40.270
"Is Yang Guo

744
31:40.550 --> 31:44.240
a fool or a sly fox?

745
31:45.070 --> 31:46.590
If he's a fool,

746
31:48.880 --> 31:51.640
how can he be so clever?"

747
31:59.310 --> 32:01.590
From then on, I began to understand

748
32:02.200 --> 32:04.590
that everyone has two lives.

749
32:05.400 --> 32:06.510
Your second life begins

750
32:06.510 --> 32:08.440
when you realize

751
32:09.400 --> 32:10.960
you only

752
32:11.400 --> 32:12.400
have one life.

753
32:17.400 --> 32:18.920
Do you know

754
32:19.270 --> 32:21.470
why I sent you away when you were little?

755
32:23.750 --> 32:24.920
Because I was sick.

756
32:27.750 --> 32:28.550
No.

757
32:29.480 --> 32:31.110
I was scared.

758
32:32.110 --> 32:33.510
I was afraid you'd suffer

759
32:34.110 --> 32:35.170
if you stayed here.

760
32:42.920 --> 32:44.240
Sometimes, fear

761
32:45.070 --> 32:46.510
comes from caring.

762
32:48.480 --> 32:49.270
Son,

763
32:49.920 --> 32:51.650
stop being so hard on yourself.

764
32:52.350 --> 32:53.550
You and that girl...

765
32:54.110 --> 32:55.270
Deep down,

766
32:55.590 --> 32:57.790
you already know the answer, don't you?

767
33:15.830 --> 33:17.370
When I went looking for you today,

768
33:17.370 --> 33:22.460
[Electrical Panel. Danger: High Voltage.] [No Smoking. No Open Flames.]

769
33:18.160 --> 33:20.560
they told me you were in the operating room.

770
33:20.750 --> 33:22.350
I figured you hadn't eaten,

771
33:23.110 --> 33:23.880
right?

772
33:26.590 --> 33:27.790
How is it?

773
33:29.270 --> 33:30.070
It's okay.

774
33:31.880 --> 33:32.550
Oh, come on.

775
33:32.550 --> 33:33.510
"It's okay"?

776
33:33.510 --> 33:35.110
Can't you just say it's good?

777
33:37.590 --> 33:38.400
It's good.

778
33:42.160 --> 33:44.360
Why are you being so cooperative today?

779
33:49.070 --> 33:49.720
Ai Chen,

780
33:49.720 --> 33:52.180
how about we keep things this way from now on?

781
33:52.680 --> 33:53.920
In your dreams!

782
33:54.440 --> 33:56.770
You think I'm gonna cook for you every day?

783
33:57.270 --> 33:58.270
I let you get a little comfortable,

784
33:58.270 --> 33:59.720
and now you're getting carried away?

785
33:59.720 --> 34:00.720
Not happening!

786
34:01.270 --> 34:02.590
That's not what I meant.

787
34:02.590 --> 34:03.850
Then what did you mean?

788
34:07.350 --> 34:08.150
Nothing.

789
34:15.420 --> 34:15.880
[Electrical Panel. Danger: High Voltage.]

790
34:19.710 --> 34:20.639
Come on, tell me.

791
34:21.800 --> 34:24.400
Are you thinking what I think you're thinking?

792
34:25.400 --> 34:26.280
What?

793
34:28.510 --> 34:29.590
Is it?

794
34:30.030 --> 34:31.030
Hurry up,

795
34:31.960 --> 34:33.030
tell me.

796
34:34.480 --> 34:35.590
Is it or not?

797
34:36.150 --> 34:37.880
Where's this call coming from?

798
34:38.800 --> 34:40.190
Why isn't this quite

799
34:40.190 --> 34:41.320
what I imagined?

800
34:42.710 --> 34:43.510
Answer it.

801
34:43.510 --> 34:44.590
Sounds urgent.

802
34:45.480 --> 34:46.280
Just a second.

803
34:46.800 --> 34:47.590
Hello.

804
34:49.800 --> 34:51.000
Mr. Tan, right?

805
34:51.510 --> 34:53.110
I heard from your mother

806
34:53.110 --> 34:54.370
that you're overseas.

807
34:56.280 --> 34:56.920
Yes.

808
34:56.920 --> 34:59.440
We were going over the list

809
34:59.440 --> 35:00.970
until after 4 AM yesterday.

810
35:02.920 --> 35:04.550
The songs are set: "Eighteen Levels of Hell,"

811
35:04.550 --> 35:05.670
"Seven Gates of Mourning,"

812
35:05.670 --> 35:06.480
and...

813
35:08.360 --> 35:10.160
Oh, we can sing "Grand Funeral."

814
35:11.400 --> 35:12.360
I... I can't do it right now.

815
35:12.360 --> 35:12.960
I'm out at the moment.

816
35:12.960 --> 35:15.220
How about I sing it for you a little later?

817
35:16.000 --> 35:18.260
You're waiting for a connecting flight?

818
35:18.320 --> 35:19.760
-But on my end... -It's fine.

819
35:19.760 --> 35:21.160
This room is soundproof.

820
35:21.840 --> 35:23.320
Mr. Tan, I'm all set here.

821
35:24.360 --> 35:25.150
And...

822
35:25.480 --> 35:26.960
please accept my condolences.

823
35:26.960 --> 35:27.960
"Grand Funeral."

824
35:28.800 --> 35:36.280
Love and hate linger on,

825
35:37.000 --> 35:43.400
through generations of joy and sorrow.

826
35:45.280 --> 35:51.590
The long road of life

827
35:52.840 --> 35:59.110
is filled with one trial after another...

828
36:03.590 --> 36:05.190
Mr. Tan, are you still there?

829
36:07.840 --> 36:08.550
I understand, I really do.

830
36:08.550 --> 36:10.810
I really understand how you're feeling.

831
36:10.880 --> 36:12.230
Then it's settled.

832
36:13.230 --> 36:14.320
All right, all right. Don't worry.

833
36:14.320 --> 36:15.110
I'll have everything

834
36:15.110 --> 36:16.770
taken care of before you land.

835
36:17.480 --> 36:18.680
All right, all right.

836
36:20.400 --> 36:21.070
Well...

837
36:22.280 --> 36:23.280
Just imagine how awful he must feel

838
36:23.280 --> 36:24.960
up there on the plane.

839
36:33.510 --> 36:34.440
What were you...

840
36:35.400 --> 36:36.670
what were you about to say just now?

841
36:36.670 --> 36:37.920
Say it again.

842
36:39.190 --> 36:40.070
I forgot.

843
36:40.630 --> 36:41.840
How could you forget?

844
36:43.590 --> 36:45.510
It's just the two of us here.

845
36:45.510 --> 36:47.070
What's there to be embarrassed about?

846
36:47.070 --> 36:47.960
I'm not embarrassed.

847
36:47.960 --> 36:49.090
I really did forget.

848
36:49.670 --> 36:51.510
We're both Northeasterners through and through.

849
36:51.510 --> 36:53.070
Don't be so hesitant.

850
36:55.510 --> 36:56.970
You know what? Never mind.

851
36:57.150 --> 36:58.280
Don't say anything.

852
37:01.670 --> 37:02.480
I'll say it.

853
37:05.510 --> 37:07.030
When it comes to someone I like,

854
37:07.030 --> 37:09.290
I have no problem putting my pride aside.

855
37:10.070 --> 37:11.030
From now on,

856
37:12.070 --> 37:13.360
if you haven't eaten

857
37:13.360 --> 37:14.670
and I'm free, I'll cook for you

858
37:14.670 --> 37:15.510
and bring you a nice,

859
37:15.510 --> 37:16.400
hot meal.

860
37:16.550 --> 37:17.190
But there's one thing

861
37:17.190 --> 37:18.920
we need to agree on first.

862
37:19.320 --> 37:20.550
If I can't bring you food,

863
37:20.550 --> 37:21.950
you can't just go hungry.

864
37:22.360 --> 37:23.490
Eating irregularly

865
37:23.880 --> 37:24.960
like that

866
37:24.960 --> 37:26.160
can't be good for you.

867
37:26.800 --> 37:27.630
I'm

868
37:28.800 --> 37:29.760
pretty good

869
37:29.760 --> 37:30.840
at taking care of myself,

870
37:30.840 --> 37:31.670
so you don't

871
37:31.670 --> 37:33.030
have to worry about me.

872
37:33.550 --> 37:35.070
As for my schedule,

873
37:35.070 --> 37:36.920
you'll have to be a little flexible.

874
37:36.920 --> 37:37.670
I usually work

875
37:37.670 --> 37:39.190
into the early hours of the morning,

876
37:39.190 --> 37:39.920
okay?

877
37:40.920 --> 37:43.150
We'll work when it's time to work,

878
37:44.510 --> 37:46.570
and go on dates when it's time to date.

879
37:49.280 --> 37:50.150
So...

880
37:51.000 --> 37:52.230
Starting today,

881
37:53.400 --> 37:55.280
we're authentically...

882
37:58.150 --> 37:58.960
well,

883
37:59.150 --> 38:00.510
officially,

884
38:01.590 --> 38:02.800
I mean officially together.

885
38:02.800 --> 38:03.930
How does that sound?

886
38:08.880 --> 38:10.030
Come on.

887
38:11.440 --> 38:12.510
After everything I just said,

888
38:12.510 --> 38:13.880
all you're gonna do is nod?

889
38:13.880 --> 38:15.740
You're supposed to say "mm-hmm".

890
38:17.920 --> 38:18.630
Mm-hmm.

891
38:19.920 --> 38:20.630
Mm-hmm!

892
38:28.000 --> 38:29.400
Why are you staring at me?

893
38:33.230 --> 38:34.630
Hey, where are you going?

894
38:37.230 --> 38:38.830
I'll cover it up again later.

895
38:38.920 --> 38:41.850
But listen, there's something I need to tell you now.

896
38:42.400 --> 38:44.800
The light needs to shine right on your face.

897
38:56.280 --> 38:56.880
Mom,

898
38:56.880 --> 38:57.800
your timing

899
38:57.800 --> 38:58.960
couldn't be better.

900
39:02.070 --> 39:03.510
Why is Dad making a will?

901
39:08.150 --> 39:09.150
Right here. Right here.

902
39:08.490 --> 39:09.990
[Convenience Grocery Store]

903
39:09.990 --> 39:10.500
[Fucheng Huaide Funeral Center]

904
39:10.360 --> 39:10.920
Thank you.

905
39:10.610 --> 39:15.630
[Fucheng Taxi]

906
39:15.230 --> 39:16.000
You're back.

907
39:16.000 --> 39:16.710
Zhao.

908
39:24.070 --> 39:24.920
What's going on?

909
39:24.920 --> 39:25.650
You're back.

910
39:26.960 --> 39:28.360
Sweetheart, have a seat.

911
39:32.920 --> 39:35.000
I had a medical checkup a couple of days ago,

912
39:35.000 --> 39:36.760
and they found something seriously wrong.

913
39:36.760 --> 39:38.030
I want to make a will,

914
39:39.480 --> 39:41.340
and I'd like you all to witness it.

915
39:43.480 --> 39:44.740
What's wrong with you?

916
39:45.230 --> 39:47.590
You'll find out once

917
39:49.230 --> 39:50.880
I've finished discussing the will.

918
39:50.880 --> 39:51.680
Don't rush me.

919
39:52.000 --> 39:53.330
How can I not be worried?

920
39:53.840 --> 39:55.840
You got the results and didn't say a word.

921
39:55.840 --> 39:56.800
What exactly is the illness?

922
39:56.800 --> 39:57.880
I don't know.

923
39:58.280 --> 39:59.710
He won't tell us,

924
39:59.710 --> 40:01.710
and he won't even show us the report.

925
40:02.880 --> 40:03.670
Amy,

926
40:04.920 --> 40:05.840
I've got

927
40:07.230 --> 40:08.320
some savings.

928
40:10.320 --> 40:11.960
I'll leave them all to you.

929
40:14.150 --> 40:15.630
As for the shop

930
40:16.480 --> 40:17.480
and its assets,

931
40:17.480 --> 40:19.280
you two will split them equally.

932
40:19.480 --> 40:21.030
Dad, I don't want it.

933
40:21.030 --> 40:22.190
It should be yours.

934
40:25.550 --> 40:26.400
And you...

935
40:28.400 --> 40:29.930
I can't judge who you should

936
40:31.030 --> 40:34.190
spend the rest of your life with.

937
40:34.590 --> 40:36.590
But what worries me most is your mom.

938
40:37.760 --> 40:38.480
You...

939
40:39.030 --> 40:40.480
Can't you just

940
40:40.480 --> 40:41.800
-let me finish? -Have a look please.

941
40:41.800 --> 40:42.480
Don't worry just yet.

942
40:42.480 --> 40:43.630
Let me take a look.

943
40:45.710 --> 40:46.910
Can you see anything?

944
40:50.550 --> 40:51.880
There's nothing wrong.

945
40:52.360 --> 40:53.280
What's the matter?

946
40:53.280 --> 40:54.510
Where exactly is it located?

947
40:54.510 --> 40:56.320
He's a brain specialist.

948
40:56.320 --> 40:58.520
How would he know anything about lungs?

949
40:59.550 --> 41:00.280
The lungs.

950
41:01.960 --> 41:02.590
Of course I know.

951
41:02.590 --> 41:03.590
Why wouldn't I?

952
41:04.320 --> 41:05.030
If you know,

953
41:05.030 --> 41:06.710
h-how come you couldn't tell?

954
41:06.840 --> 41:07.900
I can see what it is.

955
41:08.190 --> 41:08.760
You've got

956
41:08.760 --> 41:10.360
a lung nodule, right?

957
41:10.550 --> 41:11.480
It's right here,

958
41:11.510 --> 41:13.310
about five millimeters across.

959
41:13.550 --> 41:14.000
Am I right?

960
41:14.000 --> 41:14.920
Exactly!

961
41:14.920 --> 41:16.450
It's five millimeters now,

962
41:16.480 --> 41:17.320
but in a year,

963
41:17.760 --> 41:18.670
or two years,

964
41:18.840 --> 41:19.960
it'll keep growing,

965
41:19.960 --> 41:21.840
like a bean

966
41:21.840 --> 41:23.110
swelling up in water!

967
41:23.150 --> 41:24.510
Who told you that?

968
41:24.760 --> 41:26.150
Doctors wouldn't even bother

969
41:26.150 --> 41:27.810
treating a nodule that small.

970
41:27.880 --> 41:28.670
They wouldn't bother?

971
41:28.670 --> 41:29.230
There's nothing wrong with him.

972
41:29.230 --> 41:29.920
I...

973
41:30.030 --> 41:31.960
I-I looked it up online.

974
41:32.150 --> 41:32.670
Dad.

975
41:32.670 --> 41:33.400
You scared the life out of me.

976
41:33.400 --> 41:35.000
So this "serious illness"

977
41:35.320 --> 41:36.150
you're talking about is just a nodule?

978
41:36.150 --> 41:37.360
-That's right. -I knew it.

979
41:37.360 --> 41:38.280
You're making a mountain out of a molehill.

980
41:38.280 --> 41:39.710
What's that supposed to mean?

981
41:39.710 --> 41:41.440
A nodule

982
41:41.920 --> 41:43.880
could turn cancerous even by tomorrow!

983
41:43.880 --> 41:45.150
Oh, give it a rest.

984
41:45.150 --> 41:46.280
Don't talk nonsense.

985
41:46.280 --> 41:47.590
He said there's no need to treat it.

986
41:47.590 --> 41:48.320
It might not even grow

987
41:48.320 --> 41:49.360
by the time you're 90.

988
41:49.360 --> 41:50.510
Y-You're just scaring yourself.

989
41:50.510 --> 41:52.760
Even if it does grow, it's easily treatable.

990
41:52.760 --> 41:53.400
Chen,

991
41:53.400 --> 41:54.360
stay here and keep Dad company.

992
41:54.360 --> 41:55.150
I've gotta get back to the internet café.

993
41:55.150 --> 41:56.030
I've got a bunch of people waiting for me.

994
41:56.030 --> 41:56.590
Go on, have fun.

995
41:56.590 --> 41:57.150
I'm off, Chen.

996
41:57.150 --> 41:57.880
See you.

997
41:57.960 --> 41:59.000
Wait, but...

998
41:59.320 --> 42:00.120
this thing...

999
42:00.320 --> 42:01.590
-I'll continue then. -You can barely even see it

1000
42:01.590 --> 42:02.510
without a magnifying glass.

1001
42:02.510 --> 42:03.280
See?

1002
42:03.280 --> 42:04.000
But

1003
42:04.030 --> 42:06.150
what if the surgery doesn't go well?

1004
42:06.280 --> 42:07.760
Who said you need surgery?

1005
42:07.760 --> 42:08.550
You don't.

1006
42:08.880 --> 42:10.150
I said what if.

1007
42:10.630 --> 42:12.560
What if something happens to me...

1008
42:14.670 --> 42:15.480
Can you two

1009
42:15.480 --> 42:17.230
let me finish?

1010
42:18.760 --> 42:19.590
Really.

1011
42:26.880 --> 42:27.670
Zhengliang,

1012
42:28.030 --> 42:29.440
from now on, Ai Chen

1013
42:29.710 --> 42:30.960
is in your care.

1014
42:33.030 --> 42:34.690
We'll take care of each other.

1015
42:37.110 --> 42:38.510
Let's go out and celebrate!

1016
42:38.510 --> 42:39.150
Sounds good!

1017
42:39.150 --> 42:40.000
What are we eating?

1018
42:40.000 --> 42:40.360
You pick.

1019
42:40.360 --> 42:41.290
What the heck...

1020
42:41.440 --> 42:42.190
You decide.

1021
42:42.230 --> 42:43.190
Don't make him decide.

1022
42:43.190 --> 42:43.760
It's on us.

1023
42:43.760 --> 42:44.880
You're still talking about food?

1024
42:44.880 --> 42:45.630
How about barbecue?

1025
42:45.630 --> 42:46.320
Barbecue sounds good.

1026
42:46.320 --> 42:46.960
Barbecue is fine.

1027
42:46.960 --> 42:48.030
An's restaurant.

1028
42:48.030 --> 42:48.760
An's restaurant?

1029
42:48.760 --> 42:50.400
-All right. I'll call... I'll call a car. -Come on, let's go!

1030
42:50.400 --> 42:51.320
-Hurry up and call a car. -Call the car.

1031
42:51.320 --> 42:52.360
It's always packed there.

1032
42:52.360 --> 42:53.160
I'm not going.

1033
42:54.230 --> 42:55.550
Charcoal-grilled food causes cancer.

1034
42:55.550 --> 42:57.150
All right, then you can stay here and watch the shop.

1035
42:57.150 --> 42:59.400
I'll bring you some fresh vegetables with dipping sauce.

1036
42:59.400 --> 43:01.550
You probably can't have the sauce right now, though.

1037
43:01.550 --> 43:03.030
I'll bring you some oden instead.

1038
43:03.030 --> 43:03.760
The car's here. Let's go.

1039
43:03.760 --> 43:04.400
Let's go!

1040
43:04.840 --> 43:08.000
My mom is the best mom in the world.

1041
43:09.360 --> 43:10.070
-He... -He's not going.

1042
43:10.070 --> 43:10.590
Let's go.

1043
43:10.590 --> 43:11.550
H-He's really not coming?

1044
43:11.550 --> 43:12.320
What about the will!
